 "title": "CL series thick film chip resistors, 0805, 1206, 2010 and 2512",
 "source": {
  "revision": "REV: A3",
  "pages": 14
 },
 "summary": "The CL series is a family of thick film resistors on a ceramic chip in four sizes, 0805, 1206, 2010 and 2512, rated 1/8 W to 1 W at 70 °C. Values run from 1 Ω to 10 MΩ in the E-24, E-48 and E-96 series, with tolerances from ±0.1% to ±10%, plus a zero-ohm jumper in each size. The parts suit reflow and wave soldering, are RoHS and halogen-free compliant, and come on paper or embossed plastic tape.",
